  "contact": "contact.png",
  "notes": [
    "Transparent albedo (props atlas, logo B, catch fence) is UASTC, not ETC1S, because ETC1S fringes alpha.",
    "Logo B Hammer Yellow and the sky hexes are ungraded. All other albedos are also ungraded; runtime applies the shared grade.",
    "Stand sprite in the hero/follow-cam is bleachers_crowd (seated low-poly spectators). Empty bleachers remain in the props atlas.",
    "Wall has a sponsor-free dusk navy / cream / Hammer Yellow identity band. Heights remain Physics PR #88: 1.2 m wall, 3.0 m catch fence.",
    "Hero still is hero/hometown_hero_r5.png (1920x1080, same framing as r2\u2013r4). Follow cam is hero/hometown_followcam_r5.png (2340x1080 at 22 px/m). r1\u2013r4 kept.",
    "Infield is dirt. Outfield beyond the wall is gravel_lot (no grass). grass_* stays on disk, unused.",
    "CK1 sunset stops (ungraded): #25143A #381B44 #562652 #7A3658 #AC594E #B8654C.",
    "Clay targets ungraded: tacky #5B432F, slick #6F5945. HSV delta from r4 graded dirt: +6.8\u00b0 / -0.06 / -0.15.",
    "Light beams aim down onto the clay with pools and a small head glow. Poles sit outside the fence. Follow-cam clay spray is preview-only.",
    "Real-track refs (USGS, reference only) in ref_real/; sources in ref_real/sources.txt.",
    "Comparison sheet: hero/r5_vs_real.png.",
    "r5 clay is locked (Matthew 6:50 PM PT: 'Keep this clay color').",
    "Light pools: lights/light_pool.png (UASTC additive, 512\u00b2, 38.3\u00b0) plus per-pole data in manifest.json and lights/light_pool.json.",
    "Canonical gravel_lot maps are in outfield/; copies remain in infield/.",
    "Wide-view horizon silhouette: sky/horizon_strip.png (2048x256, UASTC, tiles on U). Town glow #C27858, suggested gradient height 160 px."
  ],
